### login user (email password)

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mir@gmail.com",
  "password": "Abc123!@"
}


### google login

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/google HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mir@gmail.com",
  "fcmToken": "fcm3",
  "fullname": "Mir Bin A. Karim"
}


### apple login

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/apple HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appleId": "appleId1",
  "email": "apple1@gmail.com",
  "fcmToken": "fcm3",
  "fullname": "Mir Bin A. Karim"
}


### change password

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-pass HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{shahjalal}}

{
  "newPassword": "Aw32@320",
  "oldPassword": "Aw32@320am"
}


### send forgot pass otp

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/send-forgot-otp HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mir@gmail.com"
}


### verify forgot pass otp

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-forgot-otp HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mir@gmail.com",
  "otp": "7652"
}


